  <skos:Collection rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#trivio">
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Trivio</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Trivium</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Trivium</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Trivio</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Trivium</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Trivium</rdfs:label>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q205186"/>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#grammatica">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:notation>grammatica</skos:notation>
        <trv:identificativoCategoria rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">10</trv:identificativoCategoria>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Grammatica</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Grammar</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Grammatica</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Grammatica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Grammar</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Grammatica</rdfs:label>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/grammatica/"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">A partire dal vastissimo rizoma ellenistico della grammatikē technē — l'arte totale della lettura, dell'esegesi, della cura dei testi e della comprensione del linguaggio — la categoria "grammatica" funziona da attualizzazione del campo della "lettera", proiettato nell'orizzonte cognitivo e tecnologico del nostro tempo. Grammatica è dunque il grembo sintetico di tutte le branche fiorite da quell'antico slancio verso la decodifica del mondo, la disciplina che eleva a scienza scritture e archiscritture, testi e ipertesti, lingue e linguaggi, tipi e caratteri, segni e comunicazioni.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Starting from the vast Hellenistic rhizome of the grammatikē technē, the total art of reading, exegesis, care of texts and understanding of language, the category 'grammar' actualises the field of the 'letter', projected onto the cognitive and technological horizon of our time. Grammar is thus the synthetic womb of all the branches that flowered from that ancient drive to decode the world: the discipline that raises to science writings and arche-writings, texts and hypertexts, tongues and languages, types and characters, signs and communications.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">A vastissimo rhizomate Hellenistico artis grammaticae, artis totius legendi, interpretandi, textus curandi et sermonem intellegendi, categoria 'grammatica' campum 'litterae' in horizonte cognitivo et technologico aetatis nostrae renovat. Grammatica igitur est sinus syntheticus omnium ramorum ex illo antiquo impetu mundum decodificandi natorum: disciplina quae scripturas et archiscripturas, textus et hypertextus, linguas et sermones, typos et characteres, signa et communicationes ad scientiam evehit.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q8091"/>
        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/metrum#ford-6-2"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#scrittura"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#testo"/>
      </trv:Disciplina>
    </skos:member>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#dialettica">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:notation>dialettica</skos:notation>
        <trv:identificativoCategoria rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9</trv:identificativoCategoria>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Dialettica</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Dialectic</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Dialectica</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Dialettica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dialectic</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Dialectica</rdfs:label>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/dialettica/"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Arte scaturita dall'agone nel discorso, la tecnica del dialogo è ancora il filo conduttore che, attraverso la maestria dell'analisi e della sintesi, mena l'indagine razionale attraverso i territori della logica, della storia e della cibernetica, per sollevare il velame che oscura la conoscenza del mondo.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An art born of the contest in discourse: the technique of dialogue is still the guiding thread that, through mastery of analysis and synthesis, leads rational inquiry across the territories of logic, history and cybernetics, to lift the veil that darkens the knowledge of the world.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">Ars ex certamine sermonis orta: ars dialogi adhuc filum ductorium est quod, peritia analysis et synthesis, inquisitionem rationalem per regiones logicae, historiae et cyberneticae ducit, ut velum quod cognitionem mundi obscurat tollat.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q9453"/>
        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/metrum#ford-6-3"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#praticaDialogica"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#reminiscenza"/>
      </trv:Disciplina>
    </skos:member>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#retorica">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:notation>retorica</skos:notation>
        <trv:identificativoCategoria rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">11</trv:identificativoCategoria>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Retorica</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Rhetoric</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Rhetorica</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Retorica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Rhetoric</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Rhetorica</rdfs:label>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/retorica/"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Coronamento del Trivio classico e vertice pragmatico del linguaggio, la categoria "retorica" racchiude l'arte della persuasione e l'architettura del potere, configurandosi come forgia dell'azione sociale, entro la quale il discorso si fa legge, amministrazione e strategia. È il dominio in cui la parola plasma le masse e i confini, spingendosi fino all'intima ingegneria del pensiero e trasformandosi in forza motrice capace di governare e riprogrammare la realtà umana.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Crown of the classical trivium and pragmatic summit of language, the category 'rhetoric' holds the art of persuasion and the architecture of power, shaping itself as the forge of social action in which discourse becomes law, administration and strategy. It is the domain where the word moulds masses and borders, reaching into the intimate engineering of thought and becoming a driving force able to govern and reprogram human reality.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">Corona trivii classici et vertex pragmaticus sermonis, categoria 'rhetorica' artem persuadendi et architecturam potestatis complectitur, ut fabrica actionis socialis in qua sermo fit lex, administratio et consilium. Est regio in qua verbum multitudines et fines format, usque ad intimam machinationem cogitationis pervenit et vis movens fit quae res humanas regere et reformare potest.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q81009"/>
        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/metrum#ford-6-2"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#condivisione"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#esplicitezza"/>
      </trv:Disciplina>
    </skos:member>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Le tre arti del discorso. Sono le categorie con più articoli e il nome del modulo.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The three arts of discourse. They are the categories with most articles and the name of the module.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">Tres artes sermonis. Categoriae pluribus articulis instructae et nomen partis.</skos:scopeNote>
  </skos:Collection>
  <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#beni-culturali">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
