  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#">
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#v0.1.0"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <dcterms:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/aenigma#"/>
    <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>trv</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
    <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Trivium. Le arti e le discipline della Cripta Semantica</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Trivium. The arts and disciplines of the Cripta Semantica</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Trivium. Artes et disciplinae Cryptae Semanticae</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:title xml:lang="it">Trivium. Le arti e le discipline della Cripta Semantica</dcterms:title>
    <dcterms:title xml:lang="en">Trivium. The arts and disciplines of the Cripta Semantica</dcterms:title>
    <dcterms:title xml:lang="la">Trivium. Artes et disciplinae Cryptae Semanticae</dcterms:title>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Secondo modulo di Aenigma. Schemi SKOS delle discipline, dei generi editoriali, delle linee di programma e delle stanze del sito, con etichette in tre lingue, descrizioni d'autore, corrispondenze Wikidata verificate e ponti verso le discipline FORD e verso Dubium.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Second module of Aenigma. SKOS schemes of the disciplines, editorial genres, programme lines and rooms of the site, with labels in three languages, the author's descriptions, verified Wikidata correspondences and bridges to the FORD fields and to Dubium.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="la">Secunda pars Aenigmatis. Schemata SKOS disciplinarum, generum editoriorum, linearum consilii et cellarum situs, cum titulis trium linguarum, descriptionibus auctoris, consensionibus Wikidata probatis et pontibus ad disciplinas FORD et ad Dubium.</rdfs:comment>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="it">Il nome riprende il trivio delle arti liberali: grammatica, dialettica e retorica sono le tre categorie fondanti del sito, affiancate da un quadrivio in cui la geografia prende il posto della geometria. Le altre categorie sono rami di questi tronchi o sezioni del lavoro editoriale.</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">The name recalls the trivium of the liberal arts: grammar, dialectic and rhetoric are the three founding categories of the site, flanked by a quadrivium in which geography takes the place of geometry. The other categories are branches of these trunks or sections of the editorial work.</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="la">Nomen trivium artium liberalium resumit: grammatica, dialectica et rhetorica tres categoriae situs fundamentales sunt, quibus quadrivium adiungitur in quo geographia locum geometriae tenet. Ceterae categoriae rami horum truncorum vel partes operis editorii sunt.</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"/>
    <dcterms:creator rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/chi-siamo/finai/"/>
    <dcterms:creator rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/chi-siamo/alessandro-sevardi/"/>
    <dcterms:publisher rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/"/>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/wp-json/wp/v2/categories"/>
    <dcterms:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-11-11</dcterms:issued>
    <dcterms:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-11-11</dcterms:modified>
    <dcterms:language>it</dcterms:language>
    <dcterms:language>en</dcterms:language>
    <dcterms:language>la</dcterms:language>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://github.com/FINAI-Is-Not-An-Influencer/Aenigma"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/articoli/"/>
  </owl:Ontology>
