    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Quadrivium</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Quadrivium</rdfs:label>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q273822"/>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#matematica">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:notation>matematica</skos:notation>
        <trv:identificativoCategoria rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">12</trv:identificativoCategoria>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Matematica</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Mathematics</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Mathematica</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Matematica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Mathematics</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Mathematica</rdfs:label>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/matematica/"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Arte della reminiscenza attraverso enti che mediano fra il sensibile e l'intelligibile, linguaggio della natura che non crea ed è creata, studio a priori dello spazio e del tempo, o scienza dell'immaginazione e della costruzione dei significati, polo opposto e complementare della metafisica, la matematica è da sempre e ancor oggi la lente che espande e dettaglia il godimento contemplativo.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Art of recollection through beings that mediate between the sensible and the intelligible, language of a nature that does not create and is created, a priori study of space and time, or science of imagination and of the construction of meanings, opposite and complementary pole of metaphysics: mathematics has always been, and still is, the lens that expands and details contemplative enjoyment.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">Ars reminiscentiae per entia quae inter sensibile et intellegibile mediant, lingua naturae quae non creat et creatur, studium a priori spatii et temporis, vel scientia imaginationis et constructionis significationum, polus oppositus et complementarius metaphysicae: mathematica semper fuit et adhuc est lens quae fruitionem contemplativam amplificat et distinguit.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q395"/>
        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/metrum#ford-1-1"/>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/dubium#reminiscenza"/>
      </trv:Disciplina>
    </skos:member>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#musica">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:notation>musica</skos:notation>
        <trv:identificativoCategoria rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">15</trv:identificativoCategoria>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Musica</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Music</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="la">Musica</skos:prefLabel>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Musica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Music</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">Musica</rdfs:label>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://criptasemantica.it/musica/"/>
        <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Arte di tutte le arti e scienza di tutte le scienze, scaturigine della poesia e della tecnica occidentale, apparenza della volontà come volontà, la musica è l'attività metafisica fondamentale dell'uomo che abita la Terra.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Art of all arts and science of all sciences, wellspring of Western poetry and technics, appearance of the will as will: music is the fundamental metaphysical activity of the human being who dwells on the Earth.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="la">Ars omnium artium et scientia omnium scientiarum, fons poesis et technicae occidentalis, species voluntatis ut voluntatis: musica est actio metaphysica fundamentalis hominis Terram incolentis.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q638"/>
        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/metrum#ford-6-4"/>
      </trv:Disciplina>
    </skos:member>
    <skos:member>
      <trv:Disciplina rdf:about="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#astronomia">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://aenigma.criptasemantica.it/trivium#discipline"/>
